Package: remote-desk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libpipewire-0.3-0, libx11-6
Description: Privacy-first, low-latency remote desktop system
 Remote-Desk enables encrypted, high-performance remote desktop streaming and
 remote input control without relying on centralized third-party servers.
 .
 Features Ed25519 identity, SAS mutual verification, Wayland PipeWire
 capture, and fail-safe stuck-key release.
